{"n":19,"title":"Ordering like a local","blurb":"Заказывать еду и напитки в кафе","steps":[{"stage":"Разминка","type":"note","title":"Ordering like a local","sub":"","html":"<p>«Что такое крок-месье?» — выживание в кафе, включая вопрос, что это такое.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Заказывать еду и напитки</li><li>Спрашивать, что это такое</li><li>Просить счёт</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Разминка","type":"pick","title":"Что вы заказываете в кафе?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"coffee"},{"label":"tea"},{"label":"water"},{"label":"cake"},{"label":"sandwich"},{"label":"juice"}]},{"stage":"Слова","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"coffee","pos":"","ru":"кофе","kk":"кофе","def":"A coffee, please.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M4.6 8.2h11.2v5.9a4.2 4.2 0 0 1-4.2 4.2H8.8a4.2 4.2 0 0 1-4.2-4.2z\"/><path d=\"M15.8 9.6h1.7a2.2 2.2 0 0 1 0 4.4h-1.7\"/><path d=\"M7.6 3.4v2.2M11 3.4v2.2\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/dc1f77a310a3.mp3"},{"en":"tea","pos":"","ru":"чай","kk":"шай","def":"I'd like a tea.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M4.6 8.2h11.2v5.9a4.2 4.2 0 0 1-4.2 4.2H8.8a4.2 4.2 0 0 1-4.2-4.2z\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.2h1.5a1.9 1.9 0 0 1 0 3.8h-1.5\"/><path d=\"M10.2 8.2V4.6h4.4\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/6c1fed5d75d2.mp3"},{"en":"orange juice","pos":"","ru":"апельсиновый сок","kk":"апельсин шырыны","def":"An orange juice, please.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M12 8.2c-1.4-1.6-4.2-2-5.9-.3-2 2-1.6 6 .5 8.9 1 1.4 2.3 2.6 3.5 2.6.9 0 1.4-.5 1.9-.5s1 .5 1.9.5c1.2 0 2.5-1.2 3.5-2.6 2.1-2.9 2.5-6.9.5-8.9-1.7-1.7-4.5-1.3-5.9.3z\"/><path d=\"M12 8.2V5.4c0-1.2 1-2.2 2.4-2.4\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/3b2edbd1c56f.mp3"},{"en":"water","pos":"","ru":"вода","kk":"су","def":"Can I have some water?","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M12 3.6s5.8 6.2 5.8 9.9a5.8 5.8 0 1 1-11.6 0C6.2 9.8 12 3.6 12 3.6z\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/2d4011137657.mp3"},{"en":"milk","pos":"","ru":"молоко","kk":"сүт","def":"A macchiato is coffee with milk.","img":null,"icon":"<rect x=\"4.4\" y=\"2.8\" width=\"15.2\" height=\"18.4\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M8 7.4h8\"/><path d=\"M8.4 12h.02M12 12h.02M15.6 12h.02M8.4 16.4h.02M12 16.4h.02M15.6 16.4h.02\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/cf5dbf0ec57d.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Слова","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите напиток.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/bb542328846f.mp3","prompt":"","options":["orange juice","apple juice","water"],"answer":"apple juice","html":""},{"stage":"Слова","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите закуску.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/8667fd7e9ab6.mp3","prompt":"","options":["cake","croissant","biscuit"],"answer":"croissant","html":""},{"stage":"Слова","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"cake","pos":"","ru":"торт / пирожное","kk":"торт","def":"A piece of cake, please.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M4.4 20.4h15.2v-5a2.4 2.4 0 0 0-2.4-2.4H6.8a2.4 2.4 0 0 0-2.4 2.4z\"/><path d=\"M8 13V9.6M12 13V9.4M16 13V9.6\"/><path d=\"M8 7.4c0-1 1-1.2 1-2.2M12 7.2c0-1 1-1.2 1-2.2M16 7.4c0-1 1-1.2 1-2.2\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/da2a13c975df.mp3"},{"en":"sandwich","pos":"","ru":"сэндвич","kk":"сэндвич","def":"A croque monsieur is a kind of sandwich.","img":null,"icon":"<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13.4\" r=\"6.6\"/><path d=\"M6.6 13.4h10.8\"/><path d=\"M12 6.8V4.2\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/a48549fb5f12.mp3"},{"en":"salad","pos":"","ru":"салат","kk":"салат","def":"I'd like a salad.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M12 20.4v-6.8\"/><path d=\"M12 13.6c0-3.2 2.4-5.8 5.4-5.8 0 3.2-2.4 5.8-5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M12 15.4c-3 0-5.4-2.6-5.4-5.8 3 0 5.4 2.6 5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M7.4 20.4h9.2\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/e09434b5a8d9.mp3"},{"en":"biscuit","pos":"","ru":"печенье","kk":"печенье","def":"Tea and a biscuit.","img":null,"icon":"<rect x=\"4.4\" y=\"2.8\" width=\"15.2\" height=\"18.4\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M8 7.4h8\"/><path d=\"M8.4 12h.02M12 12h.02M15.6 12h.02M8.4 16.4h.02M12 16.4h.02M15.6 16.4h.02\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/>","audio":"/course/a0/audio/ad59847fca41.mp3"},{"en":"menu","pos":"","ru":"меню","kk":"мәзір","def":"Would you like to see the menu?","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M4 5.6c2.6-1.1 5.3-1.1 8 0v13c-2.7-1.1-5.4-1.1-8 0z\"/><path d=\"M12 5.6c2.7-1.1 5.4-1.1 8 0v13c-2.6-1.1-5.3-1.1-8 0z\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/252a25667dc7.mp3"},{"en":"bill","pos":"","ru":"счёт","kk":"шот","def":"Can we have the bill, please?","img":null,"icon":"<rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"18\" height=\"12.6\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 9.6h13.4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"12.3\" r=\"1\" class=\"icon-fill\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c692d6a10598.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Слова","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"coffee","right":"кофе"},{"left":"water","right":"вода"},{"left":"cake","right":"торт / пирожное"},{"left":"salad","right":"салат"},{"left":"sandwich","right":"сэндвич"},{"left":"menu","right":"меню"}],"options":["салат","торт / пирожное","сэндвич","вода","кофе","меню"]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Одно — утверждение, другое — вопрос.","items":[{"text":"I'd like some water.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/656b5e1b3ed0.mp3"},{"text":"Have you got any milk?","src":"/learning/audio/a0/2ae2ef2bc8f3.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"some / any","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Когда</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>I'd like some water.</td><td>positive</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>There isn't any milk.</td><td>negative</td></tr><tr><td>?</td><td>Have you got any biscuits?</td><td>question</td></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>Would you like some tea?</td><td>offers — some, not any</td></tr></table><p><b>Some</b> — в утверждениях, <b>any</b> — в отрицаниях и вопросах.</p><p>Но при <b>предложении</b> — <b>some</b>: Would you like some tea?</p><p>Воду, молоко и кофе не считают — без <b>a</b> и без <b>-s</b>.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"cols","title":"Считается или не считается?","sub":"","columns":["a sandwich, two cakes","some water, some milk"],"items":[{"text":"milk","col":1},{"text":"croissant","col":0},{"text":"biscuit","col":0},{"text":"water","col":1},{"text":"sandwich","col":0},{"text":"coffee","col":1}]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"would like","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Заметка</th></tr><tr><td>order</td><td>I'd like a coffee, please.</td><td>I'd = I would</td></tr><tr><td>offer</td><td>Would you like a coffee?</td><td>polite offer</td></tr><tr><td>+ verb</td><td>Would you like to see the menu?</td><td>would like to + verb</td></tr></table><p><b>I'd like</b> — вежливый заказ. <b>I want</b> звучит грубо.</p><p>После would like — предмет или <b>to</b> + глагол: I'd like <b>to</b> see the menu.</p><p>На предложение отвечают <b>Yes, please.</b> или <b>No, thanks.</b></p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">How much is it? будет в уроке 20.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Would you like a coffee?","Yes, please.","I'd like a tea and a croissant.","Can I have some water, please?","What's a croque monsieur?","Can we have the bill, please?"]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I'd like ___ water, please.","options":["a","some","any"],"keep":false,"answer":"some","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"There isn't ___ milk.","options":["some","a","any"],"keep":false,"answer":"any","why":"Отрицание → any.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Would you like ___ tea?","options":["some","any","a lot"],"keep":false,"answer":"some","why":"В предложении угощения — some.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"like a coffee, please.","answers":["I'd"],"bank":["I'm","I do","I'd"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Would you like","after":"see the menu?","answers":["to"],"bank":["for","to","a"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Have you got","after":"sandwiches?","answers":["any"],"bank":["any","a","some of"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Would you like a coffee?","options":["Yes, I would like.","Oh, yes, please.","Yes, I do."],"keep":false,"answer":"Oh, yes, please.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Anything else?","options":["No, thanks. That's all.","No, I'm not.","Yes, I like."],"keep":false,"answer":"No, thanks. That's all.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Is everything OK here?","options":["Fine, thank you.","Yes, I'd like.","No, thanks, I can."],"keep":false,"answer":"Fine, thank you.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["would","please.","I","a","like","coffee,"],"answer":"I would like a coffee, please.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["bill,","the","please?","we","have","Can"],"answer":"Can we have the bill, please?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","monsieur?","croque","What","a"],"answer":"What is a croque monsieur?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","want","a","coffee."],"bad":1,"answer":"I'd like a coffee, please.","why":"Вежливо — I'd like."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I'd","like","a","water."],"bad":2,"answer":"I'd like some water.","why":"Воду не считают — нужно some."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["There","isn't","some","milk."],"bad":2,"answer":"There isn't any milk.","why":"Отрицание → any."},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/79f3e4e15241.mp3","prompt":"— What's a croque monsieur?","options":["a kind of coffee","a kind of sandwich","a kind of cake"],"answer":"a kind of sandwich","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4ff0d65a82a0.mp3","prompt":"Что такое buñuelo?","options":["a kind of doughnut","a kind of salad","a kind of juice"],"answer":"a kind of doughnut","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/80c6377d6f54.mp3","before":"A macchiato is a kind of coffee, with","after":".","answers":["milk"],"bank":["milk","water","sugar"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/5598606c567a.mp3","prompt":"Какой вопрос вы слышите?","options":["Would you like to order?","What would you like?","When would you like to go?"],"answer":"What would you like?","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/learning/audio/a0/e037618f4d27.mp3","before":"","after":"like a tea.","answers":["I'd"],"bank":["I'd","I","I'm"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/b5755818b314.mp3","prompt":"Что официант предлагает сначала?","options":["the bill","the menu","a table for four"],"answer":"the menu","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4f1377cb124d.mp3","prompt":"Что заказывает посетитель?","options":["a burger and chips","a salad and water","a coffee and cake"],"answer":"a burger and chips","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/4f1377cb124d.mp3","before":"— Small or large? —","after":", please.","answers":["Large"],"bank":["Large","Small","Two"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Нуру.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nura</p><p>Hi! I'm Nura. I go to the same café every morning.</p><p>I'd like a coffee and a croissant, please.</p><p>There isn't any milk in my coffee — I drink it black.</p><p>At lunch I usually have a sandwich and some water.</p>"},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Nura orders a coffee and a croissant.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nura</p><p>Hi! I'm Nura. I go to the same café every morning.</p><p>I'd like a coffee and a croissant, please.</p><p>There isn't any milk in my coffee — I drink it black.</p><p>At lunch I usually have a sandwich and some water.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"She has milk in her coffee.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nura</p><p>Hi! I'm Nura. I go to the same café every morning.</p><p>I'd like a coffee and a croissant, please.</p><p>There isn't any milk in my coffee — I drink it black.</p><p>At lunch I usually have a sandwich and some water.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"At lunch she has a sandwich and","after":"water.","answers":["some"],"bank":["a","any","some"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Nura</p><p>Hi! I'm Nura. I go to the same café every morning.</p><p>I'd like a coffee and a croissant, please.</p><p>There isn't any milk in my coffee — I drink it black.</p><p>At lunch I usually have a sandwich and some water.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"write","title":"Напишите свой заказ в кафе.","sub":"Две позиции, вежливо.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I'd like ___ , please.</li><li>Can I have ___ , please?</li><li>___ is a croque monsieur?</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'd like</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Can I have</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">some</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">coffee</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">water</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a sandwich</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a cake</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">please</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">What</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Я использовал(а) <b>I'd like</b> или <b>Can I have</b>, а не «I want».</li><li>С water, milk, coffee — <b>some</b>, а не <b>a</b>.</li><li>Я написал(а) <b>please</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Говорите дружелюбно — это просьба.","items":["I'd like a coffee, please.","Can I have some water?","What's a croque monsieur?","Can we have the bill, please?"],"itemAudio":["/learning/audio/a0/166ba27947ea.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/cb355b14223d.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/e6b89c6997bd.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/12d127077da6.mp3"]},{"stage":"Итоги","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 19 пройден","sub":"Урок 19 из 24 · Юнит 5 пройден","items":["Я могу заказать еду и напитки.","Я могу спросить, что это такое.","Я могу попросить счёт."]}]}
